<p class="govuk-body">A <strong>programme requirement</strong> helps you make positive changes in your life.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">This means you may need to go to activities that focus on your thinking and behaviours. These are sometimes called interventions or accredited programmes. The Building choices programme is one example.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">It is important to remember if you do not complete the programme, you could go back to court.</p>
